---
# GLSL stages are formatted with the repository C++ style (code/.clang-format).
# clang-format has no GLSL mode; these macro expansions only teach it that
# `uniform Name { ... } instance;` and `buffer Name { ... };` are blocks, so the
# instance name stays on the closing line.
BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig
Macros:
  - 'uniform=struct'
  - 'buffer=struct'
...
